It's strange, how the more you play Crawl the more you start thinking 
how much better Nethack would be if this or that Crawl feature were 
implemented. Of course the basic approach is different between them so 
balancing the effects would be a pain.

Just today I was toying with the idea of giving rodneY Xoms all-time 
favorite ability "animate weapon". It would bypass magic resistance and 
cancellation, because it wouldn't be direted at the player but at the 
weapon (magicbane would probably resist). Thinking about the monster 
structure in Nethack this would be a pain to implement, but it would 
give the wizard a new nasty trick. It still wouldn't balance high-level 
wizards but would give monks a slight edge...

